ouldn't ever really need to buy a frame or weapon from the market directly, they can all be earned pretty easily by teaming up with other players, which the game makes it really easy to do. Honestly, even buying premium stuff not on sale feels like I'm making out like a bandit, this game is just so good. I'm only really harping on this one point because a lot of people instantly dismiss f2p games, while this game feels and plays better than 99% of things out there, full stop.", "timestamp_created": 1759274203, "timestamp_updated": 1759274203, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205578962", "author": {"steamid": "76561199223246400", "personaname": "Chaotic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199223246400/", "num_games_owned": 8, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 44198, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 41605, "last_played": 1780216274, "avatar": "79c1fd2cd84971fc5cb8a2647343c0e99f71c646"}, "language": "english", "review": "me see enemy. me nuke. me get dopamine.", "timestamp_created": 1759274122, "timestamp_updated": 1759274122, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205577658", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051457507", "personaname": "2Gunnz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198051457507/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 40667, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 11, "playtime_a